## 8. Why This Matters

SIMON's README is already honest about what it proves and what it doesn't. This study extends that honesty into a new dimension:

> **We cannot yet prevent wash-compute. But we can measure it, and measurement is the first step toward mitigation.**

This is not a silver bullet. It is a **net**, not a sword.

